1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,930
Meta offered 2 billion dollars for this AI.

2
00:00:05,220 --> 00:00:08,130
And you can try it for free.

3
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:14,030
This is Manus. Not a regular chatbot, an AI agent.

4
00:00:14,150 --> 00:00:24,590
You give it a task, it opens a browser, finds the information and finishes the job: a report, slides, even a website.

5
00:00:24,750 --> 00:00:28,420
Last December, Meta tried to buy it.

6
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:31,970
But in April, China blocked the deal.

7
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:38,570
Manus stayed independent and this October raised over half a billion dollars.

8
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:44,700
The free plan gives you credits every day, but a complex task burns through them fast.

9
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:51,330
Tip: start with a small task. For example, have it list your competitors.

10
00:00:51,490 --> 00:00:56,220
In the future we won't chat with AI. We'll give it work.

